            {
              "text": "After her father died, her other parent family members treated her very badly.",
              "audioStart": 5.45,
              "audioEnd": 9.8
            },
            {
              "text": "She had to work all day while they rested in the big rooms.",
              "audioStart": 10.662,
              "audioEnd": 13.5
            },
            {
              "text": "She always worked hard from early morning until late evening without any help.",
              "audioStart": 14.363,
              "audioEnd": 18.312
            },
            {
              "text": "She kept her mind quiet and hoped that something good would happen to her life soon.",
              "audioStart": 19.175,
              "audioEnd": 23.262
            },
            {
              "text": "Her days were long and full of difficult tasks that made her feel very tired.",
              "audioStart": 24.125,
              "audioEnd": 28.238
