            {
              "text": "Every single hour passed slowly while she did everything that was asked of her.",
              "audioStart": 47.7,
              "audioEnd": 51.462
            },
            {
              "text": "Her family never gave her any kind words or gentle smiles during those hard years.",
              "audioStart": 52.325,
              "audioEnd": 56.85
            },
            {
              "text": "She felt that if she worked harder, her life might change into something better.",
              "audioStart": 57.712,
              "audioEnd": 61.575
            },
            {
              "text": "Although her family gave her many tasks, she tried to remain positive and calm.",
              "audioStart": 62.438,
              "audioEnd": 66.65
            },
            {
              "text": "She always washed the dishes and swept the floors before the sun went down.",
              "audioStart": 67.513,
              "audioEnd": 71.5
            },
            {
              "text": "Sometimes she sat near the wall and thought about what her mother would say.",
              "audioStart": 72.362,
              "audioEnd": 75.7
            },
            {
              "text": "Her mother would have told her to be strong and keep her head up.",
              "audioStart": 76.562,
              "audioEnd": 79.45
            },
            {
              "text": "She knew that if she had a different family, her life would be much easier.",
              "audioStart": 80.312,
              "audioEnd": 84.037
            },
            {
              "text": "However, she accepted her position and continued to do whatever they wanted.",
              "audioStart": 84.9,
              "audioEnd": 88.963
            },
            {
              "text": "The house was old and cold, but she managed to keep herself busy all day.",
              "audioStart": 89.825,
              "audioEnd": 93.737
            },
            {
              "text": "Every room was filled with dust that she had to clean away by hand.",
              "audioStart": 94.6,
              "audioEnd": 97.95
            },
            {
              "text": "She never complained about the work because she hoped for a better future.",
              "audioStart": 98.812,
              "audioEnd": 102.3
            },
            {
              "text": "Her sisters wore fine clothes and went out to various places in the town.",
              "audioStart": 103.162,
              "audioEnd": 106.987
            },
            {
              "text": "Cinderella stayed behind and watched them leave with a small smile on her face.",
              "audioStart": 107.85,
              "audioEnd": 111.912
            },
            {
              "text": "She wondered what it felt like to be free and enjoy a nice evening.",
              "audioStart": 112.775,
              "audioEnd": 116.112
            },
            {
              "text": "Perhaps one day she would also experience a wonderful event outside her home.",
              "audioStart": 116.975,
              "audioEnd": 120.938
            },
            {
              "text": "Until that moment arrived, she would continue to do her work without question.",
              "audioStart": 121.8,
              "audioEnd": 125.812
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "One day, a grand party invitation arrived from the king for everyone in the town.",
