              "text": "She felt very sad because she wanted to go to the great event too.",
              "audioStart": 136.45,
              "audioEnd": 139.825
            },
            {
              "text": "She sat down by the warm stone wall and let her tears fall down her face.",
              "audioStart": 140.688,
