            },
            {
              "text": "Then she left the house and traveled toward the grand royal castle with great excitement.",
              "audioStart": 167.787,
              "audioEnd": 172.2
            },
            {
              "text": "The night was dark, but the stars shone brightly above her head as she moved forward.",
              "audioStart": 173.062,
              "audioEnd": 177.412
            },
            {
              "text": "When she arrived at the large building, everyone looked at her with great surprise.",
